<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>utxoproof advisory</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 1000px; margin: 2em auto; padding: 0 1em; color: #222; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 1em 0; font-size: 0.9em; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #999; padding: 0.4em 0.6em; text-align: right; }
  th:first-child, td:first-child, td:nth-child(9) { text-align: left; }
  th { background: #eee; }
  .disclaimer { font-size: 0.85em; color: #555; border-top: 1px solid #999; margin-top: 2em; padding-top: 1em; }
  @media print {
    body { margin: 0; }
    tr { page-break-inside: avoid; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>utxoproof advisory</h1>
<p>As of {{ as_of }} at {{ current_price_eur }} EUR/BTC ({{ price_note }}).
Ranked by tax cost if sold. Selling everything today would cost
{{ total_tax_eur }} EUR in tax.</p>

<h2>Per-UTXO table</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>UTXO</th><th>BTC</th><th>Holding (days)</th><th>Cost (EUR)</th><th>Value (EUR)</th><th>Gain (EUR)</th><th>Tax if sold (EUR)</th><th>KYC</th><th>Flags</th></tr>
  {% for a in advisories %}
  <tr><td>{{ a.utxo }}</td><td>{{ a.btc }}</td><td>{{ a.holding_days }}</td><td>{{ a.cost_eur }}</td><td>{{ a.value_eur }}</td><td>{{ a.gain_eur }}</td><td>{{ a.tax_eur }}</td><td>{{ a.kyc }}</td><td>{{ a.flags }}</td></tr>
  {% endfor %}
</table>

<h2>Summary</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Item</th><th>EUR</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Total tax cost of liquidating</td><td>{{ total_tax_eur }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Estate-candidate value</td><td>{{ estate_value_eur }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Borrow-candidate value</td><td>{{ borrow_value_eur }}</td></tr>
</table>

<p class="disclaimer">{{ disclaimer }}</p>
</body>
</html>
